{
  "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
  "duration_s": 696.0,
  "generated_at": "2026-09-04T02:59:13.409253+00:00",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0000",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 0,
      "start_s": 0.08,
      "end_s": 9.84,
      "text": "In 1994, rangers at a game reserve in South Africa started finding dead rhinos, poachers.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0001",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 1,
      "start_s": 5.92,
      "end_s": 13.759,
      "text": "Obviously, there was no second theory except the horn was still attached.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0002",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 2,
      "start_s": 9.84,
      "end_s": 19.92,
      "text": "Whoever killed this rhino had left behind the only part of it worth money.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0003",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 3,
      "start_s": 13.759,
      "end_s": 22.560000000000002,
      "text": "Then they found the next body and the next about one a month every month.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0004",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 4,
      "start_s": 19.92,
      "end_s": 30.799999999999997,
      "text": "And on every carcass the same impossible wounds, deep punctures driven down into the back and shoulders from above, broken ribs.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0005",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 5,
      "start_s": 26.88,
      "end_s": 37.120000000000005,
      "text": "One animal had internal injuries that could only have come from something enormous kneeling on top of it.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0006",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 6,
      "start_s": 32.64,
      "end_s": 38.800000000000004,
      "text": "And around every kill site, the same signature.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0007",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 7,
      "start_s": 34.88,
      "end_s": 40.718999999999994,
      "text": "Flattened brush, uprooted trees, and pressed into the dirt.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0008",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 8,
      "start_s": 38.8,
      "end_s": 42.959999999999994,
      "text": "Footprints the size of dinner plates.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0009",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 9,
      "start_s": 40.719,
      "end_s": 45.120000000000005,
      "text": "Elephant tracks.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0010",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 10,
      "start_s": 40.719,
      "end_s": 45.120000000000005,
      "text": "This is Palanesburg.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0011",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 11,
      "start_s": 42.96,
      "end_s": 50.559,
      "text": "It's the cleanest answer anyone has ever gotten to a much older question.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0012",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 12,
      "start_s": 45.12,
      "end_s": 52.8,
      "text": "Why the young need the old?",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0013",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 13,
      "start_s": 47.76,
      "end_s": 57.28,
      "text": "The tracks made no sense because elephants do not kill rhinos.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0014",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 14,
      "start_s": 52.8,
      "end_s": 61.120000000000005,
      "text": "The two species have shared a continent for millions of years, mostly by ignoring each other.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0015",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 15,
      "start_s": 57.28,
      "end_s": 66.72,
      "text": "In the rare recorded cases where an elephant killed one, it was a mother defending her calf at a water hole.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0016",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 16,
      "start_s": 63.12,
      "end_s": 66.72,
      "text": "This was different.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0017",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 17,
      "start_s": 65.04,
      "end_s": 69.6,
      "text": "Some of the victims had been chased down first, attacked again and again.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0018",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 18,
      "start_s": 68.32,
      "end_s": 74.88,
      "text": "Whatever was doing this was not defending anything.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0019",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 19,
      "start_s": 69.6,
      "end_s": 74.88,
      "text": "It was hunting.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0020",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 20,
      "start_s": 69.6,
      "end_s": 84.32,
      "text": "In 1979, South Africa took a ring of old volcanic hills covered in worn out farmland and decided to turn it back into wild Africa.",
      "n_words": 25
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0021",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 21,
      "start_s": 78.64,
      "end_s": 86.96,
      "text": "Around 6,000 animals were trucked in.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0022",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 22,
      "start_s": 81.6,
      "end_s": 89.36,
      "text": "an entire ecosystem delivered by road.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0023",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 23,
      "start_s": 84.32,
      "end_s": 94.799,
      "text": "And in 1980, the elephants arrived, 18 of them, every single one a child.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0024",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 24,
      "start_s": 89.36,
      "end_s": 96.64,
      "text": "Orphans between 4 and 6 years old.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0025",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 25,
      "start_s": 92.0,
      "end_s": 98.4,
      "text": "Not one adult came with them.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0026",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 26,
      "start_s": 94.799,
      "end_s": 100.64,
      "text": "And the reason why is the dark heart of this story.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0027",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 27,
      "start_s": 96.64,
      "end_s": 102.32000000000001,
      "text": "The orphans came from Krueger National Park.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0028",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 28,
      "start_s": 98.4,
      "end_s": 106.079,
      "text": "Krueger had the opposite problem from almost every other park in Africa.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0029",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 29,
      "start_s": 102.32,
      "end_s": 111.119,
      "text": "Fenced in and protected from poaching, it had too many elephants.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0030",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 30,
      "start_s": 106.079,
      "end_s": 114.88,
      "text": "So from 1967 onward, it did what was considered responsible wildlife management at the time.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0031",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 31,
      "start_s": 111.119,
      "end_s": 116.799,
      "text": "Every year it called them.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0032",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 32,
      "start_s": 113.04,
      "end_s": 124.15899999999999,
      "text": "A helicopter would come in low over a herd and a marksman would shoot the matriarch first, the oldest female, the one carrying the family's entire memory.",
      "n_words": 27
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0033",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 33,
      "start_s": 120.719,
      "end_s": 128.399,
      "text": "Where the water is in a drought year, which things are dangerous, how worried to be.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0034",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 34,
      "start_s": 124.159,
      "end_s": 131.039,
      "text": "When she is calm, everyone is calm.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0035",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 35,
      "start_s": 126.079,
      "end_s": 133.04,
      "text": "And when she falls, nobody runs.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0036",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 36,
      "start_s": 128.399,
      "end_s": 134.72,
      "text": "Elephants don't abandon their dead.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0037",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 37,
      "start_s": 131.039,
      "end_s": 138.16,
      "text": "The family gathers around her body and tries to lift her back up.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0038",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 38,
      "start_s": 134.72,
      "end_s": 142.64,
      "text": "So the shooters would work through them where they stood one by one until the whole herd was down.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0039",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 39,
      "start_s": 138.16,
      "end_s": 144.48000000000002,
      "text": "The logic was that this was the humane version.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0040",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 40,
      "start_s": 142.64,
      "end_s": 153.44,
      "text": "Leaving survivors in a species that remembers everything was considered cruer than erasing the whole unit at once.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0041",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 41,
      "start_s": 148.56,
      "end_s": 155.599,
      "text": "More than 14,000 elephants were killed this way over three decades.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0042",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 42,
      "start_s": 151.28,
      "end_s": 157.76,
      "text": "But the youngest calves were spared.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0043",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 43,
      "start_s": 153.44,
      "end_s": 159.44,
      "text": "Not out of mercy exactly.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0044",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 44,
      "start_s": 155.599,
      "end_s": 163.44,
      "text": "They were spared because they were the only ones small enough to move.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0045",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 45,
      "start_s": 159.44,
      "end_s": 165.76,
      "text": "No crane in existence could transport a six-tonon adult.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0046",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 46,
      "start_s": 161.44,
      "end_s": 167.68,
      "text": "a calf you could load.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0047",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 47,
      "start_s": 163.44,
      "end_s": 172.31900000000002,
      "text": "So the calves stood by while their entire families were shot.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0048",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 48,
      "start_s": 167.68,
      "end_s": 176.16,
      "text": "Then they were rounded up, put on trucks, and sold or donated to parks that wanted elephants again.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0049",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 49,
      "start_s": 172.319,
      "end_s": 177.92,
      "text": "Parks like Palanisburg.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0050",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 50,
      "start_s": 174.16,
      "end_s": 178.959,
      "text": "Nobody involved was a villain.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0051",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 51,
      "start_s": 176.16,
      "end_s": 182.56,
      "text": "The officials knew the orphans might struggle, but the alternative was shooting them, too.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0052",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 52,
      "start_s": 180.64,
      "end_s": 193.68,
      "text": "Saving the children was the good option, and so a brand new park received 18 traumatized orphans, tipped them out into the bush, and left them to raise themselves.",
      "n_words": 29
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0053",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 53,
      "start_s": 188.8,
      "end_s": 195.35999999999999,
      "text": "A wild calf grows up inside a moving wall of adults.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0054",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 54,
      "start_s": 191.44,
      "end_s": 198.87900000000002,
      "text": "Every hour of its childhood, a demonstration of what an elephant is supposed to be.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0055",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 55,
      "start_s": 195.36,
      "end_s": 202.39999999999998,
      "text": "At Palanesburg, the wall was made of other children.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0056",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 56,
      "start_s": 198.879,
      "end_s": 204.8,
      "text": "Within 2 years, the managers could tell something was off.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0057",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 57,
      "start_s": 200.959,
      "end_s": 208.8,
      "text": "The youngsters were nervous, unruly, aggressive.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0058",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 58,
      "start_s": 204.8,
      "end_s": 214.319,
      "text": "So, in 1982, the park brought in two adult females, hoping a little supervision would settle them down.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0059",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 59,
      "start_s": 210.48,
      "end_s": 219.04,
      "text": "Two mothers for a population of children that would eventually grow to around 70.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0060",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 60,
      "start_s": 214.319,
      "end_s": 221.76,
      "text": "And the deliveries kept coming.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0061",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 61,
      "start_s": 216.48,
      "end_s": 221.76,
      "text": "More calls, more orphans.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0062",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 62,
      "start_s": 216.48,
      "end_s": 225.35999999999999,
      "text": "Year after year until 1993, the park was full of elephants and empty of adults.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0063",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 63,
      "start_s": 221.76,
      "end_s": 228.959,
      "text": "The oldest elephants those orphans had ever known were each other.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0064",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 64,
      "start_s": 225.36,
      "end_s": 235.51899999999998,
      "text": "Through the 1980s, they grew up and the park started seeing behavior never documented in elephants anywhere.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0065",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 65,
      "start_s": 230.879,
      "end_s": 238.4,
      "text": "Safari vehicles got mock charged, then actually charged.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0066",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 66,
      "start_s": 235.519,
      "end_s": 240.239,
      "text": "Tourists were chased.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0067",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 67,
      "start_s": 235.519,
      "end_s": 241.76000000000002,
      "text": "In 1993, one of the young bulls killed a tourist.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0068",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 68,
      "start_s": 238.4,
      "end_s": 245.92,
      "text": "A professional hunter was sent in to destroy him.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0069",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 69,
      "start_s": 241.76,
      "end_s": 247.92,
      "text": "The elephant killed him, too, before he could take the shot.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0070",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 70,
      "start_s": 243.92,
      "end_s": 252.64,
      "text": "And the following year, the rhinos started dying.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0071",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 71,
      "start_s": 247.92,
      "end_s": 258.71999999999997,
      "text": "In a normal year, Palanisburg lost a rhino to natural causes every 2 or 3 months.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0072",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 72,
      "start_s": 252.64,
      "end_s": 260.56,
      "text": "In the 3 months after April 1994, 10 rhinos died violently.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0073",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 73,
      "start_s": 255.28,
      "end_s": 263.04,
      "text": "Five more were found wounded.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0074",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 74,
      "start_s": 258.72,
      "end_s": 264.88,
      "text": "By the end of the year, the count was 20.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0075",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 75,
      "start_s": 260.56,
      "end_s": 271.44,
      "text": "The white rhino had been down to a few dozen animals a century earlier, nursed back one calf at a time.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0076",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 76,
      "start_s": 267.28,
      "end_s": 275.199,
      "text": "Now, something inside a protected reserve was killing them faster than poachers ever had.",
