      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 85,
      "start_s": 295.36,
      "end_s": 304.0,
      "text": "The killings stopped.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0086",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 86,
      "start_s": 297.84,
      "end_s": 306.08,
      "text": "Then in 1996, 20 more rhinos died.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0087",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 87,
      "start_s": 301.68,
      "end_s": 309.35999999999996,
      "text": "The park had shot the wrong elephants, or at least not the only ones.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0088",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 88,
      "start_s": 306.08,
      "end_s": 313.6,
      "text": "So, they ran a two-year surveillance operation on their own animals.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0089",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 89,
      "start_s": 309.36,
      "end_s": 316.08,
      "text": "Rangers marked suspects with paint from helicopters.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0090",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 90,
      "start_s": 311.68,
      "end_s": 321.19899999999996,
      "text": "Researchers built an identicate file on every male in the park.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0091",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 91,
      "start_s": 316.08,
      "end_s": 323.199,
      "text": "Ear notches, tusk shapes, scars.",
