    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0092",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 92,
      "start_s": 319.039,
      "end_s": 328.08000000000004,
      "text": "They were effectively compiling wrap sheets and they gave their suspects names.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0093",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 93,
      "start_s": 323.199,
      "end_s": 330.72,
      "text": "One young bull, a regular near the death scenes, they called Tom Thumb.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0094",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 94,
      "start_s": 328.08,
      "end_s": 334.40000000000003,
      "text": "In 1997, they finally caught a young male in the act.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0095",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 95,
      "start_s": 330.72,
      "end_s": 336.40000000000003,
      "text": "in daylight, killing a white rhino.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0096",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 96,
      "start_s": 332.639,
      "end_s": 338.15999999999997,
      "text": "By now, there were two competing explanations.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0097",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 97,
      "start_s": 334.4,
      "end_s": 339.67999999999995,
      "text": "The first was trauma.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0098",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 98,
      "start_s": 336.4,
      "end_s": 345.28000000000003,
      "text": "These animals had watched their families die, and a childhood like that, some argued, could only end in violence.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0099",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 99,
      "start_s": 341.6,
      "end_s": 346.8,
      "text": "The park's ecologists weren't convinced.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0100",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 100,
      "start_s": 343.44,
      "end_s": 348.63899999999995,
      "text": "Trauma might explain the anger.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0101",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 101,
      "start_s": 345.28,
      "end_s": 354.88,
      "text": "It couldn't explain the timing because the attacks came in clusters, and the clusters had a rhythm.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0102",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 102,
      "start_s": 350.56,
      "end_s": 357.35999999999996,
      "text": "When the surveillance data came together, the rhythm was the answer.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0103",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 103,
      "start_s": 354.88,
      "end_s": 359.36,
      "text": "Every attacker was male.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0104",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 104,
      "start_s": 354.88,
      "end_s": 364.24,
      "text": "Every attacker was one of the orphans, now in his late teens or early 20s.",
