    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0105",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 105,
      "start_s": 359.36,
      "end_s": 370.16,
      "text": "And every single one of them at the time of the attacks was in must.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0106",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 106,
      "start_s": 364.24,
      "end_s": 372.639,
      "text": "Must is a hormonal state adult bulls cycle through.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0107",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 107,
      "start_s": 367.68,
      "end_s": 374.47900000000004,
      "text": "Testosterone climbs to many times its normal level.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0108",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 108,
      "start_s": 370.16,
      "end_s": 380.0,
      "text": "The glands on the sides of the head swell and stream an oily fluid.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0109",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 109,
      "start_s": 374.479,
      "end_s": 386.72,
      "text": "The bull dribbles urine constantly, barely eats, and becomes for a while the most aggressive version of himself.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0110",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 110,
      "start_s": 382.24,
      "end_s": 389.199,
      "text": "It's normal.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0111",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 111,
      "start_s": 384.24,
      "end_s": 394.479,
      "text": "It's how bulls compete to breed, but it's meant to arrive late and arrive small.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0112",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 112,
      "start_s": 389.199,
      "end_s": 399.44,
      "text": "In a wild herd, a male leaves his family in his early teens and joins bull society.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0113",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 113,
      "start_s": 394.479,
      "end_s": 401.28,
      "text": "Loose bands of males anchored by giants in their 40s and 50s.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0114",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 114,
      "start_s": 397.039,
      "end_s": 406.4,
      "text": "He starts at the bottom and his body knows it.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0115",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 115,
      "start_s": 401.28,
      "end_s": 417.68,
      "text": "A bull hits his first musth around his late 20s and at first it lasts only days because when he runs into a real bull, his system registers that he's outranked and the state can simply switch off.",
      "n_words": 38
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0116",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 116,
      "start_s": 412.56,
      "end_s": 420.08,
      "text": "Older males act as a ceiling on younger ones just by existing.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0117",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 117,
      "start_s": 415.28,
      "end_s": 426.0,
      "text": "The Pilinesberg males were entering must around 18, a decade too early.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0118",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 118,
      "start_s": 420.08,
      "end_s": 431.44,
      "text": "And instead of days, it was lasting months, 3 months, 5 months.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0119",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 119,
      "start_s": 426.0,
      "end_s": 435.52,
      "text": "Young bodies flooded with fight hormones on a hair trigger for close to half the year.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0120",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 120,
      "start_s": 431.44,
      "end_s": 440.479,
      "text": "In a normal population, an older bull would have shut that down almost on contact.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0121",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 121,
      "start_s": 437.68,
      "end_s": 443.199,
      "text": "Palanisburg didn't contain a single one.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0122",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 122,
      "start_s": 440.479,
      "end_s": 444.96,
      "text": "Bull society didn't exist here.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0123",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 123,
      "start_s": 440.479,
      "end_s": 447.28000000000003,
      "text": "Neither did the ceiling.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0124",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 124,
      "start_s": 443.199,
      "end_s": 454.0,
      "text": "The famous killer animals of history almost always turned out to have something broken in their bodies.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0125",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 125,
      "start_s": 449.039,
      "end_s": 456.319,
      "text": "A shattered jaw, a crippled foot.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0126",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 126,
      "start_s": 451.68,
      "end_s": 460.639,
      "text": "The Pylonberg males were studied from every angle and their bodies were perfect.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0127",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 127,
      "start_s": 456.319,
      "end_s": 462.40000000000003,
      "text": "The wound was in their biography.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0128",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 128,
      "start_s": 458.16,
      "end_s": 464.479,
      "text": "The rhinos were the collision point.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0129",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 129,
      "start_s": 460.639,
      "end_s": 471.84000000000003,
      "text": "The young males had grown up loosely mixed in with them, possibly because nothing had ever taught them where elephants end and other species begin.",
      "n_words": 25
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0130",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 130,
      "start_s": 467.675,
      "end_s": 477.919,
      "text": "When the hormones hit, the nearest thing they had to arrival was a two-tonon animal that couldn't outrank them and couldn't escape them.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0131",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 131,
      "start_s": 476.24,
      "end_s": 484.40000000000003,
      "text": "By the time it was over, researchers estimated the elephants had killed as many as 49 rhinos.",
