      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 132,
      "start_s": 479.759,
      "end_s": 486.16,
      "text": "Roughly 1 in 10 of the rhinos in the park.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0133",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 133,
      "start_s": 482.639,
      "end_s": 488.4,
      "text": "Several of the orphans had been shot for it.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0134",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 134,
      "start_s": 484.4,
      "end_s": 491.84,
      "text": "Shooting their way out was the obvious next step, and Palanesburg refused to take it.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0135",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 135,
      "start_s": 490.4,
      "end_s": 499.84,
      "text": "Because by now, the park's field ecologist, Gus Van Djk, and his colleagues had arrived at a different diagnosis.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0136",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 136,
      "start_s": 495.599,
      "end_s": 501.599,
      "text": "The park didn't have bad elephants.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0137",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 137,
      "start_s": 497.599,
      "end_s": 503.28,
      "text": "The park was missing elephants.",
