      "sent_id": "_xGwOhFLdno:s0144",
      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 144,
      "start_s": 512.959,
      "end_s": 525.7600000000001,
      "text": "But by the late 1990s, engineers had built reinforced trucks and cranes that could handle six tons of living resisting animal.",
