      "video_id": "_xGwOhFLdno",
      "idx": 146,
      "start_s": 525.76,
      "end_s": 537.76,
      "text": "In early 1998 in Krueger, they captured six of them, adult bulls, 25 to 35 years old, each one bigger than anything the orphans had ever seen.",
